{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Masquerade is a murder party game for 2 to 8 players.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is both a target and a hunter, blend in with NPCs to avoid suspicion, while collecting clues to unmask and eliminate your target before your hunter gets you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.poster.avif?t=1758560449\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.webm?t=1758560449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.mp4?t=1758560449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: collect as many coins as possible before the round ends. Earn coins by eliminating your target or your hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blend in with NPCs to avoid suspicion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the map and arm yourself with deadly weapons; crossbows, dynamite, daggers, the choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify your target among the crowd, sneak close, and strike before your hunter strikes you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover the manor\u2019s secrets and hidden rooms.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Customizable games</strong>: Adjust maps, scoring rules, and timers to suit your group\u2019s style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Play with friends</strong>: Host your own private server and enjoy tense, hilarious matches together.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Maps</strong>: The Manor &amp; The Garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong>: Standard (Free-for-all) &amp; Team vs Team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong>: 8 unlockable masks &amp; 8 unlockable faces</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Egg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595530/a654392eaf2fe9bc346422a9afd44446aa9aa86d.jpg"},{"name":"10!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595530/2d3b653d2c9b78472819322044e92777e9d5aa63.jpg"},{"name":"100!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595530/39e66577ca9878c0e860e45fe59fefccb14bb98d.jpg"},{"name":"Dynamited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595530/3dfb4c6334dfa3cd1a09a953ac3fba2934c54b3c.jpg"},{"name":"First! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2595530/a8cd747410086ba3bb09915edff23de3c3d8617f.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2595530?t=1758560449","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2595530?t=1758560449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/7d7ad0cf8c9dcdca66ea21bcc8b2a9d98e98d070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758560449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/7d7ad0cf8c9dcdca66ea21bcc8b2a9d98e98d070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758560449","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"